# SPA fallbacks - routes without a prerendered file get a NEUTRAL app
# shell (loading note + directory links + the app scripts), not the
# homepage file: falling back to index.html made /es/anything statically
# serve the Spanish homepage content — a soft-404 that reads as "this
# page shows the wrong thing" to crawlers and no-JS visitors. React
# renders the real page (or its localized 404) on load. The Spanish rule
# must come before the generic one.
/es/*  /es/app-shell.html  200
/*  /app-shell.html  200
